{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Sugar &amp; Rolling Stone&quot; is a retro style side view puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control the explorer Rolling Stone and help Sugar, a girl with a magical key, reach the locked door safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use various objects to create paths, solve puzzles, and enjoy their adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Help Sugar reach the goal!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sugar can't jump while carrying a heavy key, but don't worry\u2014there are many ways to move forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/\u1102\u1161\u110b\u1174_\u1103\u1169\u11bc\u110b\u1167\u11bc\u1109\u1161\u11bc_3.gif?t=1740887593\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use cannons to launch Sugar across the map!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks to magical protection, Sugar will land safely no matter how far they fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/\u1102\u1161\u110b\u1174_\u1103\u1169\u11bc\u110b\u1167\u11bc\u1109\u1161\u11bc_4.gif?t=1740887593\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jump together with Sugar using springs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find creative ways to overcome obstacles and reach your destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/\u1102\u1161\u110b\u1174_\u1103\u1169\u11bc\u110b\u1167\u11bc\u1109\u1161\u11bc_2.gif?t=1740887593\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various gimmicks will help you solve puzzles along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join Sugar and Rolling Stone on a magical journey!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3542910?t=1740887593","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3542910?t=1740887593","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/1f221e1032a6b1a67ce02fec18fbd6e508743710/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740887593","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/1f221e1032a6b1a67ce02fec18fbd6e508743710/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740887593","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Sugar &amp; Rolling Stone&quot; is a retro style side view puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control the explorer Rolling Stone and help Sugar, a girl with a magical key, reach the locked door safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use various objects to create paths, solve puzzles, and enjoy their adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Help Sugar reach the goal!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sugar can't jump while carrying a heavy key, but don't worry\u2014there are many ways to move forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542910/extras/\u1102\u1161\u110b\u1174_\u1103\u1169\u11bc\u110b\u1167\u11bc\u1109\u1161\u11bc_3.gif?t=1740887593\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use cannons to launch Sugar across the map!</strong></p><p class=\"b